#: umc/js/ucr.js:119
msgid "Are you sure you want to save an empty string in this UCR variable or do you want to unset it?<br><br>UCR variables that were created manually are fully removed from UCR when unsetting them. Any other UCR Variable will be set to its default value."
msgstr "您確定要在此 UCR 變數中儲存空字串，還是要取消設定它？<br><br>手動建立的 UCR 變數在取消設定時會從 UCR 中完全移除。其他任何 UCR 變數則會設定為其預設值。"

