#: umc/js/ucr.js:254
msgid "The Univention Configuration Registry (UCR) is the local database for the configuration of UCS systems to access and edit system-wide properties in a unified manner. Caution: Changing UCR variables directly results in the change of the system configuration. Misconfiguration may cause an unusable system!"
msgstr "Univention Configuration Registry (UCR) 是 UCS 系統設定的本機資料庫，可用統一的方式存取及編輯系統層級的屬性。注意: 直接變更 UCR 變數會導致系統設定的變更。設定錯誤可能會使系統無法使用！"

#: umc/js/ucr.js:88
msgid "The default value of the UCR variable which is applied if the variable is not set. This might be a UCR pattern."
msgstr "在變數未設定時套用的 UCR 變數預設值。這可能是一個 UCR 樣式。"

#: umc/js/ucr.js:64 umc/js/ucr.js:308
msgid "UCR variable"
msgstr "UCR 變數"

#: umc/js/ucr.js:309
msgid "Unique name of the UCR variable"
msgstr "UCR 變數的唯一名稱"

#: umc/js/ucr.js:102 umc/js/ucr.js:124
msgid "Unset"
msgstr "取消設定"

#: umc/js/ucr.js:103 umc/js/ucr.js:125
msgid "Unsetting a manually created UCR variable is equal to deleting it. More information about this topic can be found <a href=\"https://docs.software-univention.de/manual/5.0/en/computers/ucr.html?highlight=ucr#deleting-ucr-variables\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>."
msgstr "取消設定手動建立的 UCR 變數等同於刪除它。關於此主題的更多資訊可參閱<a href=\"https://docs.software-univention.de/manual/5.0/en/computers/ucr.html?highlight=ucr#deleting-ucr-variables\" target=\"_blank\">這裡</a>。"

